# A recipe's render (tools/make_manual.py --renders): from P14, headphones, Pitch lock off, Scene time 0. Evan's moves
# (2026-11-13), made before the recording: Osc/Sb to the sub, the sub to -4 oct, drone I's pitch quickly to 22 Hz.
# The clip is the clicks, held. "# @" marks the listening times (tools/make_manual.py --times).
notips
phones 1
set 74 0
set 71 0
press SEL
tapkey w15
release SEL
tapkey w5
tap PLAY
wait 3000
tap EDIT
tap EDIT
turn K1 85 15
tapkey b1
tapkey b1
tapkey b1
tapkey b1
tapkey b1
tap HOME
tap HOME
turn K1 -33 60
wait 1000
wav ticks.wav
# @ Drone I at 22 Hz, its sub at -4 oct and all sub: clicks, about 3 a second, under drone II
wait 12000
wavstop
page 5
wait 400
shot ticks-0.png
page 1
wait 400
shot ticks-1.png
